	(text "iCE40 signals (3.3 V) on the left, translated to TGT_VCC, the logic rail the target returns on T_VCC.\nWith TGT_VCC at 0 V the translators are high-Z on both sides. SWDIO direction from the iCE40, pulled to input (R44)\nwhile the FPGA is unconfigured. nRST and IO0 open drain, as on the ESP-Prog."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
